  description:
  - This is a Lunorchid
  leftText: 
  rightText: Lunorchids are a cross hybrid between a sunflower and an orchid, retaining
    more of the dominant traits of the sunflower. It's bright glow and enticing aroma
    attract the attention of a variety of insects, including Lumen Moths and Pyreflies.
